Two commits of https://github.com/Aksem/adaptagrams (the Adaptagrams fork
that libavoid-js builds on), restricted to cola/libavoid/connector.{h,cpp}:
3f52e7e1 "Add hasValidRoute property to ConnRef" and fe73f026 "Add
hasCrossingObstacles property to ConnRef", both by Vladyslav Hnatiuk
(LGPL-2.1-or-later, like libavoid). tools/oracle/fork_route_status.sh
applies them to a copy of the vendored upstream sources with `patch -p1`.

From 3f52e7e1a45bf912dcb2eafb96663c0b97825698 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vladyslav Hnatiuk
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 11:01:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add hasValidRoute property to ConnRef

---
 cola/libavoid/connector.cpp | 10 ++++++++++
 cola/libavoid/connector.h   | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 29 insertions(+)

diff --git a/cola/libavoid/connector.cpp b/cola/libavoid/connector.cpp
index bdffa8b5..1ec198fe 100644
--- a/cola/libavoid/connector.cpp
+++ b/cola/libavoid/connector.cpp
@@ -55,6 +55,7 @@ ConnRef::ConnRef(Router *router, const unsigned int id)
       m_active(false),
       m_hate_crossings(false),
